B.A. LAB project — Licence map

B.A. LAB is used here as a project name; this file does not assert that a legal entity has been registered under that name. This repository mixes several licences. The table below states which one applies
to which directory. Where a directory is not listed, ALL RIGHTS RESERVED applies.

| Path                                                        | Licence (SPDX)                | Text                              |
|-------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------|-----------------------------------|
| firmware/                                                   | MIT                           | LICENSES/MIT.txt                  |
| hardware/                                                   | CERN-OHL-P-2.0                | LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt (*)   |
| bio-inputs/, biotech-sops/, 01_R-and-D_Lab/, docs/          | Proprietary, all rights reserved (see below) | this file          |
| batch-tracker/ (web interface)                              | Proprietary, all rights reserved (see below) | this file          |
| README.md, LICENSE, LICENSES/, index.html, assets/          | Proprietary, all rights reserved (see below) | this file          |

(*) The official CERN-OHL-P-2.0 text must be present in LICENSES/ for the hardware
licence to be complete. See LICENSES/README.md.

